      {
        "id": "SonaW",
        "name": "Aria of Perseverance",
        "description": "Sona plays the Aria of Perseverance, sending out protective melodies, healing Sona and a nearby wounded ally. Sona gains a temporary aura that grants allies tagged by the zone a temporary shield.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Active:</span> Sona restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(30/45/60/75/90 + (30% Ability Power)) Health</span> to herself and a nearby allied champion, prioritizing the most wounded. She then begins a new <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Melody</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Melody:</span> Sona gains an aura for 3 seconds, granting allied champions <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(25/45/65/85/105 + (25% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Gain a stack of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Accelerando</span> whenever you heal another injured ally and every time you protect another ally from at least 25/45/65/85/105 damage with this shield.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Power Chord - Diminuendo:</span> Power Chord also reduces physical and magic damage dealt by the target by (25% + (0.04% Ability Power)) for 3 seconds.",
